ablish the exact whole-record targets/bases and independently", "authenticate the scoped human decision; this tool never reports a current approved", "source-IG exclusion or transfers semantic acceptance.", "", "## Local usage and dependencies", "", "Use existing bundled pypdf, pdfplumber, Pillow and Poppler (pdfinfo, pdftoppm). No", "network calls, installs or global configuration changes occur in these tools. Supply", "the bundle's site-packages to the local interpreter using a process-only PYTHONPATH;", "exact paths, library versions, executable hashes and rendering settings belong in", "the operational report. Synthetic fixtures do not contain publisher text. The CLI", "requires `private/` for publisher inputs and derived outputs.", "", "```text", "python -m wgc.sources inventory --pdf private/.../rulebook.pdf --provenance private/.../provenance.json --source-id source:spqr:5e:core --sha256 HASH --output private/.../new-run", "python -m wgc.sources inventory ... --registry private/.../new-run/identity-registry.json --output private/.../replay", "python -m wgc.sources evidence --inventory private/.../new-run/inventory.json --pages 1 2 3 4 --output private/.../evidence", "python -m wgc.sources validate private/.../evidence/inventory.json", "```", "", "Run explicit `tests/sources` with a fresh short basetemp and `-p no:cacheprovider`.", "Tests cover two columns, tables/notes, cross-page structure, missing pages, duplicates,", "overlap/context, unknown labels, all rotations/nonzero box origins/UserUnit, artifact", "tampering, partial/exclusion handling and registry replay. Full source meaning,", "independent technical review and human semantic acceptance remain separate gates."], "truncated": false}

